  CLAUSE 3 -- RESOLUTION. Oracle swing scaled to a LEARNED bias by x0.407
  (ctxscale's 118 Hz F1 asymptote / this run's F1 oracle swing 289.8), then
  levels = reach / (2 x within-run sd), which is aimaxes's k=2. ASSUMPTION,
  stated and NOT measured: the learned/oracle ratio found on F1 carries.
    f0    reach    51.990 / scatter   19.624  ->   1.32 levels   (oracle swing/scatter   6.5)   (not in the product: f0 fails LINEAGE)
